    @template local_moderncommerce/guest_checkout

    Guest buyer layout: native Moodle form in the left sidebar, cart and summary
    in the main area. formhtml, errorhtml and statusactions are trusted Moodle output.

    @copyright 2026 Adebare Showemimo
    @license http://www.gnu.org/copyleft/gpl.html GNU GPL v3 or later
